{
  "slug": "memoriant-llm-gateway-skill",
  "name": "Memoriant Llm Gateway Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Compliance-first LLM gateway for Claude Code. Policy-as-code enforcement (YAML policy definitions), tamper-evident audit trails, PII redaction, token budget enforcement, and compliance evidence export. Built for regulated industries (HIPAA, SOC 2, CMMC). Includes full FastAPI gateway with 103 tests.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `llm-gateway` (Design, configure, and audit a compliance-first LLM gateway) and **1 agent**, `llm-gateway-auditor`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install memoriant-llm-gateway-skill@claude-community` from `NathanMaine/memoriant-llm-gateway-skill`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin for designing, auditing, and generating compliance evidence for a governed LLM gateway. Write policy-as-code rules, verify tamper-evident audit trails, configure PII detection, and produce SOC2/HIPAA/CMMC evidence packages.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
